at 4000 key c
at 4002 pty "c"
at 4100 key k
at 4102 pty "k"
at 4200 key space
at 4202 pty " "
at 4300 key m
at 4302 pty "m"
at 4400 key e
at 4402 pty "e"
at 4500 key ,
at 4502 pty ","
at 4600 key space
at 4602 pty " "
at 4700 key f
at 4702 pty "f"
at 4800 key u
